The song was also a commercial success in other countries . In France , it peaked at number 12 on the SNEP chart . In Germany , it reached number 11 on the GfK Entertainment charts . In Spain , it reached number 10 on the Spanish Singles Chart . In Italy , it reached number 12 on the FIMI chart . In Sweden , it reached number 13 on the Swedish Singles Chart . In Switzerland , it reached number 11 on the Swiss Singles Chart . In the Netherlands , it reached number 14 on the Dutch Top 40 . In the United Kingdom , it reached number 9 on the UK Singles Chart . In the United States , it reached number 46 on the Billboard Hot 100 . 

